type. The pattern has to be given as a value, with braces:

\begin{lstlisting}[style=dslcpp,caption={A pattern used as a dispatch key. The braces are required: the key parameter of \code{when} is declared \code{auto}, and a type name is not a constant expression.},label={lst:ch05-when}]
